notes.content:
I apologize for the long development of the game, the war in the east of Ukraine affected all spheres of life. In any case, sooner or later the game will leave early access. Thanks to everyone who supported the author, peace be with you and Happy New Year!

The update added:

[list]
[*] Now there is a machine gunner on the turret of the T-90 tank;
[*] A technology branch has been added, each side of the conflict has its own improvement branch;
[*] Phosphorus bombs have been replaced with chemical ones;
[*] Added a new research center building that generates research points;
[*] Redrawn some sprites and effects;
[*] Fixed some bugs and errors;
[*] Added new sound effects.
[/list]

Tech branch for the side of the Arab rebels:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39011762/aa6d398d7ee699c585ca38af6dba0622520454b5.png[/img]

Technology branch for the side of PMCs:

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39011762/846558ed9c93e80d9b6ac3cd69419143fde69c00.png[/img]

[list]
[*] Added more blood and meat when killing infantry, detachment of limbs;
[*] Added new music for PMCs;
[*] Some sprites have been redrawn;
[*] Now the Abrams tank has a coaxial machine gun;
[*] Added tooltips and notifications;
[*] Added new sound effects;
[*] The camera can now be moved up and down;
[*] Now the ground shakes during explosions;
[*] Effects of armor ricochets have been changed;
[*] A health bar has been added to units;
[*] Added buttons for quick selection of engineer and commander;
[*] Volcano can now shoot down drones.
[/list]

[list]
[*] An Arab engineer can now defuse a mine;
[*] Redrawn BMP-2 sprite;
[*] The PMC sniper can now hit a target with one shot, the rate of fire is reduced, the Arab sniper has a large spread of bullets, but is cheaper than the European one;
[*] Shells 25mm and 30mm now deal a lot of damage to enemy infantry;
[*] Changed the sound of the ZU-23 anti-aircraft gun to a more realistic one. 
[/list]

[list]
[*] Fixed problem with audio overload;

[*] The movement of vehicles has been debugged, now the vehicles do not get stuck;

[*] Added new sound effects;

[*] Redrawn some sprites;

[*] The drone now drops a mine with high damage;

[*] Some processes have been optimized;

[*] Tanks now have a chance to miss; 
[/list]

[list]
[*] Added an engineer with a MAC-10 submachine gun for the side of the rebels, now you can build fortifications in skirmish mode;

[*] Skirmish mode and AI have been slightly reworked;

[*] Some sprites of buildings and units were redrawn;

[*] Added new smoke and fire effects;

[*] Added sound effects and music;

[*] PMC engineer now has a Mossenberg 500 shotgun

[*] Removed Molotov cocktail thrower due to inefficiency.

[*] Game interface changed

[*] The need for provisions has been removed;

[*] Minor bugs fixed. 
[/list]

[list]
[*] Added an engineer and an M15 mine for the PMC side;
[*] Added improvised explosive devices for the insurgent side;
[*] Rebels can now build brick shelters;
[*] Now fortifications can only be built next to the engineer;
[*] An engineer repairs equipment that stands next to him, demines explosive devices;
[*] Added and changed some sound effects;
[*] Increased suicide bomber blast wave;
[*] Oil must now be conquered;
[*] The date farm and food warehouse were carved out;
[*] Minor bugs fixed. 
[/list]

[list]
[*] Minor bugs and errors fixed;
[*] Added French;
[*] Steel hedgehog can now be destroyed by armored personnel carriers and BMP-2;
[*] Increased speed of drones;
[*] Fortification in the sandbox can now be stacked on top of each other;
[*] Phosphorus bombs and A-10 have been added to the sandbox;
[*] The speed of bullets and projectiles has been increased.
[/ list]

On different systems, the movement of equipment can be accelerated or slowed down, this will soon be corrected.
